      "filename": "Lößnitzgrundbahn 991777-4.jpg",
      "title": "File:Lößnitzgrundbahn 991777-4.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/L%C3%B6%C3%9Fnitzgrundbahn_991777-4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:L%C3%B6%C3%9Fnitzgrundbahn_991777-4.jpg",
      "width": 3320,
